# Cursor AI Rules for apps/minside

> **Extends:** [Root .cursorrules](../../.cursorrules)

## App Context

This is the **user portal** for Xala/Digilist Platform.

**Critical:** ALL routes require authentication. Design mobile-first.

## Minside-Specific Rules

### 1. Authentication Required Pattern
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Protected route
import { Navigate } from 'react-router-dom';
import { useAuth } from '@digilist/client-sdk/hooks';

function ProtectedRoute({ children }) {
  const { user, isLoading } = useAuth();

  if (isLoading) return <LoadingSpinner />;
  if (!user) return <Navigate to="/login" replace />;

  return <>{children}</>;
}
```

### 2. Mobile Navigation Pattern
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Responsive navigation
import { Drawer, Sidebar } from '@xala/ds';
import { useMediaQuery } from '@xala/ds/hooks';

function AppLayout() {
  const isMobile = useMediaQuery('(max-width: 768px)');

  return isMobile ? <MobileDrawer /> : <DesktopSidebar />;
}
```

### 3. Notification Pattern
```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Real-time notifications
import { realtimeClient } from '@digilist/client-sdk';
import { useQueryClient } from '@tanstack/react-query';

function NotificationCenter() {
  const queryClient = useQueryClient();

  useEffect(() => {
    realtimeClient.onNotification((notification) => {
      showToast(notification.message);
      queryClient.invalidateQueries(['notifications']);
    });
  }, []);
}
```

### 4. GDPR Data Export Pattern
```tsx
// ✅ REQUIRED - GDPR compliance
import { useGDPR } from '@digilist/client-sdk/hooks';

function PrivacySettings() {
  const { exportData, requestDeletion } = useGDPR();

  return (
    <>
      <Button onClick={() => exportData()}>Export My Data</Button>
      <Button variant="danger" onClick={() => requestDeletion()}>
        Delete My Account
      </Button>
    </>
  );
}
```

## File Organization

```
src/
├── features/
│   ├── dashboard/        # User dashboard
│   ├── bookings/         # My bookings
│   ├── profile/          # User profile
│   ├── notifications/    # Notification center
│   ├── favorites/        # Saved listings
│   ├── payments/         # Payment methods
│   └── settings/         # User settings
├── components/layout/    # Sidebar, Header
├── routes/               # Protected routes
└── main.tsx              # Entry point
```

## Testing

- E2E tests: `../../tests/e2e/minside-*.spec.ts`
- Mobile tests: `../../tests/e2e/minside-mobile.spec.ts`
- Offline tests: `../../tests/e2e/minside-offline.spec.ts`
- Unit tests: Co-located `*.test.tsx`

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ Allowing unauthenticated access
❌ Desktop-first design (should be mobile-first)
❌ Not handling offline scenarios
❌ Missing notification subscriptions
❌ Not implementing GDPR features (export/delete)
❌ Hardcoding strings (use i18n)
❌ Direct API calls (use SDK)
❌ Importing from `@digdir/*` (use `@xala/ds`)

## SDK Services

Primary hooks used in this app:
- `useAuth()` - Authentication
- `useUser()` - User profile
- `useBookings()` - User bookings
- `useNotifications()` - Notifications
- `useFavorites()` - Saved listings
- `usePaymentMethods()` - Payment methods
- `useGDPR()` - GDPR operations
- `realtimeClient` - WebSocket notifications

## Mobile Optimization

- Minimum tap target: 44x44px
- Bottom navigation on mobile
- Drawer for sidebar on mobile
- Touch-friendly interactions
- Responsive images (srcset)
- Offline capability (service worker)

## GDPR Features Required

- ✅ Data export (JSON/CSV)
- ✅ Data deletion request
- ✅ Consent management
- ✅ Privacy settings
- ✅ Activity log

